{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get behind the wheel of a luxury electric convertible and unlock the tour guide missions! Plan your customers\u2019 itineraries and show off the city's most stunning sights in a stylish open-top car. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included in this DLC:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A luxury electric convertible \u2013 Impress your passengers with the Sizarian, a sleek VIP vehicle with a retractable roof, offering outstanding comfort for every journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Tour guide missions \u2013 No set routes here: it's up to you to plan the itinerary! Each customer will give you a final destination and sometimes a few preferred stops along the way. Pick the landmarks, set up the route on your GPS and create a custom tour that fits within the time limit. Plan carefully - too long a gap between points of interest and your client\u2019s attention will drop\u2026 along with your final tip!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576810?t=1750946666","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576810?t=1750946666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576810/d42d604db400c26f00fa32b47faab4670313577b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750946666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576810/d42d604db400c26f00fa32b47faab4670313577b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750946666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get behind the wheel of a luxury electric convertible and unlock the tour guide missions! Plan your custome